 ('One fastener size can have different washer proportions','<p>MS15795-805 and MS15795-806 both reference a #6 fastener and a nominal 0.156-inch inside diameter. Their nominal outside diameters are 0.312 and 0.375 inch, with thicknesses of 0.035 and 0.049 inch respectively.</p><p>The nominal values support identification. Drawing limits govern inspection and acceptance.</p>','SIZE COMPARISON'),
